---

## Notes

- The `error()` method in AuthenticatorAPI is currently private (line 275). It must remain
  accessible to getInfo(). The new public buildErrorResponse() wrapper (Step 7) avoids
  changing the visibility of the internal helper.

- CtapHid.assignedCids uses byte[] as a Map key which relies on reference equality, not
  content equality. The pendingUserPresence map in Step 2 must use the same reference that
  was stored in assignedCids. Verify this is consistent before implementing.

- The 15-second timeout Handler must be posted on the main (UI) thread.

- If multiple getInfo requests arrive before the first is resolved, the second should be
  rejected with CHANNEL_BUSY (0x06) or queued. For simplicity, reject with OPERATION_DENIED
  if pendingGetInfoResponse is already set.